<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">assemble-vitalis-bandolier</ansi> (alchemy recipe)

Veyra's masterwork assembly. The finished piece is joined here from four
self-crafted components and its bulk stock. This recipe is taught by
commission, never discovered at the bench, and it demands that every
component be of your own making.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       alchemy (minimum 65)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     alchemy_bench
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> Reinforced Harness (x1), Preservation Runes (x1),
               Chrysalis Filter-Membrane (x1), Still-Glass Rosette (x1),
               Pine Pitch (x6), Salt Pouch (x6), Beeswax (x4)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Learned:</ansi>     by commission from Veyra (not self-taught)

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help alchemy</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help craft</ansi>
